  "identifier": "nibabies",
  "name": "NiBabies",
  "alternateName": [
    "NiBabies Infant fMRIPrep"
  ],
  "description": "Specialised MRI preprocessing pipeline for human infant neuroimaging (0–2 years old), part of the NiPreps ecosystem. Handles the unique challenges of neonatal and infant brain MRI — inverted tissue contrast, incomplete myelination, and motion artefacts — that make adult-oriented tools like fMRIPrep unsuitable. Supports both anatomical and functional MRI. BIDS-compliant, Docker-containerised, Apache-2.0, 39 stars, v25.2.1 (October 2025). Actively maintained with 36 releases.",
